    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are numbers i can call but they don't fix the fact that i'm literally bankrupt. it's not just \"stress,\" it's the reality. i look at my kids and i just see people who are going to have nothing because of my mistakes. it feels like there's no way to win, no matter what i do. it's like a hole i'm just falling into and there's no bottom. how am i supposed to just \"find hope\" when my entire life is collapsing?",
